OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny spells and a few showers
OL,6,Fthrough the morning, the showers
OL,7,Ftending to become more frequent and
OL,8,Foccasionally heavy through the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Strong westerly winds
OL,10,Fslowly easing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mix of clear spells and
OL,13,Fshowers, the showers frequent and
OL,14,Fheavy at times. Occasionally fresh
OL,15,Fwesterly or southwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
