OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FAnother day of sunny spells
OL,6,Fand heavy showers, however the showers
OL,7,Fare expected to become less frequent
OL,8,Fby evening. Occasionally fresh
OL,9,Fsouthwesterly winds turning
OL,10,Fnorthwesterly.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,13,Ffew early showers Thursday then dry
OL,14,Fwith sunny spells. Overnight rain
OL,15,Fclears early Friday, the rest of
OL,16,FFriday and Saturday see sunny spells
OL,17,Fand frequent heavy, blustery showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
